      "description": "One of the most striking birds of the Western Palearctic — salmon-pink with bold black-and-white barred wings and a dramatic fan-shaped crest raised in alarm or display. The oop-oop-oop call carries far over open Swedish landscapes. An irregular visitor to the south, with occasional breeding records in warm years.",
